      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sulphur%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The first known settler in Sulphur was Noah Lael, who built a ranch south of Pavilion Springs in 1878.",
